orktrees' symlink). The name used to be \"$CORE_NAME-$$\", but an\n# agent's sandboxed shell runs in its own PID namespace where $$ is 2 or 3\n# for every agent, so siblings wrote into one dir and wiped each other's\n# checks mid-SBY (V2 incident 03). mktemp gives a unique name instead.\n# FORMAL_WORK_ID pins the suffix so tools/eval/formal.py can remove exactly\n# its own dir afterwards. genchecks.py derives @core\n…[24346 of 27418 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:901c6ed35d13e9f2]…\n96 Nov 22 03:41 ..\ntotal 464\ndrwxrwx---+  3 nobody nogroup   4096 Nov 22 03:41 .\ndrwxrwx---+  3 nobody nogroup   4096 Nov 22 03:41 ..\n-rw-rw----+  1 nobody nogroup   2317 Nov 22 03:41 Makefile\ndrwxrwx---+ 14 nobody nogroup   4096 Nov 22 03:41 coremark\n-rw-rw----+  1 nobody nogroup    135 Nov 22 03:41 crt0.S\n-rw-rw----+  1 nobody nogroup   6341 Nov 22 03:41 gen_random_trace.py\n-rw-rw----+  1 nobody nogroup    330 Nov 22 03:41 link.ld\n-rw-rw----+  1 nobody nogroup 140494 Nov 22 03:41 random1.S\n-rw-rw----+  1 nobody nogroup 138125 Nov 22 03:41 random2.S\n-rw-rw----+  1 nobody nogroup 142438 Nov 22 03:41 random3.S\n-rw-rw----+  1 nobody nogroup   3684 Nov 22 03:41 selftest.S\ntotal 60\ndrwxrwx---+ 2 nobody nogroup  4096 Nov 22 03:41 .\ndrwxrwx---+ 3 nobody nogroup  4096 Nov 22 03:41 ..\n-rwxrwx---+ 1 nobody nogroup  2158 Nov 22 03:41 build.sh\n-rw-rw----+ 1 nobody nogroup 14018 Nov 22 03:41 main.cpp\n-rw-rw----+ 1 nobody nogroup 13446 Nov 22 03:41 reference.py\n-rw-rw----+ 1 nobody nogroup  6611 Nov 22 03:41 run_cosim.py\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
