{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_25","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"rg -n 'fifo|RAM16|RegFile|warning|WARN|register' cores/bench/generated/timing/gowin_p0/gw.log | head -90; rg -ni 'lutram|ram16|fifo' cores/bench/generated/timing/gowin_p0/impl/gwsynthesis -g '\"'!*.v'\"' | head -60; rg -n -o '\\\".*hyp-20261122-003-r4s2.*' cores/bench/experiments/log.jsonl | cut -c1-2000; ls /opt/gowin/IDE/doc\"","aggregated_output":"95:WARN  (PR1014) : Generic routing resource will be used to clock signal 'clock_d' by the specified constraint. And then it may lead to the excessive delay or skew\ncores/bench/generated/timing/gowin_p0/impl/gwsynthesis/core_bench_syn.rpt.html:206:<td class=\"label\">&nbsp&nbsp&nbsp&nbspRAM16SDP1</td>\ncores/bench/generated/timing/gowin_p0/impl/gwsynthesis/core_bench_syn.rpt.html:247:<td>3695(3156 LUT, 491 ALU, 8 RAM16) / 20736</td>\n13:\"id\": \"hyp-20261122-003-r4s2\", \"title\": \"Run gshare ahead with a four-entry LUT-RAM fetch queue\", \"category\": \"predictor\", \"motivation\": \"EX redirects accounted for only about 63,000 cycles in the earlier gshare\\nprofile. The current champion executes ten iterations in 4,233,123 cycles\\nat 54.869 MHz, so direction accuracy alone has limited headroom. The prior\\ntwo-entry predictor runahead saved 213,930 cycles on its parent by using\\nready imem cycles during backend holds. A four-entry queue can cover\\nlonger runs of backpressure. Its payload writes and ID/EX squash need\\nshort control paths to preserve the current champion's clock rate.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": {\"motivation\": \"EX redirects accounted for only about 63,000 cycles in the earlier gshare\\nprofile. The current champion executes ten iterations in 4,233,123 cycles\\nat 54.869 MHz, so direction accuracy alone has limited headroom. The prior\\ntwo-entry predictor runahead saved 213,930 cycles on its parent by using\\nready imem cycles during backend holds. A four-entry queue can cover\\nlonger runs of backpressure. Its payload writes and ID/EX squash need\\nshort control paths to preserve the current champion's clock rate.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Give the existing gshare and direct JAL predictor an independently\\nadvancing request PC and a four-entry, flow-through circular queue of\\ncomplete fetch packets. Use a plain packed-vector array sized with\\n$bits(fetch_packet), a synchronous write at the tail and an asynchronous\\nread at the head so Gowin infers distributed SRAM. Use two pointers\\nwith an extra wrap bit. Every edge with a free tail writes the raw\\nfetch packet into that unused slot. Only a ready response that is\\nenqueued advances the write pointer. The physical write enable depends\\nonly on registered occupancy. Reset and EX recovery clear the pointers.\\nKeep a two-input select between the indexed head and a direct bypass\\nof the raw packet when empty.\\n\\nAccept a ready response whenever the queue has space. An \nCN\nEN\nJP\nRN100-1.9.11.03EducationE_Gowin Software Education Version Release Note.pdf\nRN100-1.9.11.03EducationJ_Gowinソフトウェア(教育版)リリースノート.pdf\nRN100-1.9.11.03Education_Gowin云源软件教育版本发布说明.pdf\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
