in the timed design.\n\nFetch passes the raw instruction word with readiness-derived validity. Reset, redirects, and late-result bubbles clear ID/EX validity. Backpressure holds the payload and its matches together. The existing late-result interlocks and divide operand capture continue to cover both encoded RVFI source operands.\n\nThe parallel register-file read masks are a refinement of the proposed bank selection to avoid a cascade of bank, validity, and bypass muxes. The limiting path in both median placements is inside the divider. Placement 0 is limited by a path from MEM/WB write eligibility through Execute into dmem.\n\n## Local verification\n\n- Verilator `--lint-only -Wall -Wno-MULTITOP` passed with\n…[28693 of 31765 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:95ebf03fbc3789eb]…\n RTL retries. The preprocessed ALTOPS divider matches the champion's exactly.\n\n`make fpga TARGET=bench NRET=1` placed and routed all three Gowin options at 81.954, 91.817, and 91.817 MHz with 4,618 logic cells, 143 fewer than the champion. The 91.817 MHz median gives 237.37 CoreMark iterations per second and falls below the 101.2256 MHz promotion threshold. IF recovery limited option 0. The narrow remainder recurrence limited options 1 and 2.\n\nseeds [81.954, 91.817, 91.817]\nperturbations [[0, 81.954, 11], [1, 91.817, 11], [2, 91.817, 11]]\nhyp-20261122-002-r11s1 {'fitness': 243.45, 'fmax_mhz': 94.169, 'ipc_coremark': 3e-06, 'cycles': 3868036, 'critical_path': {'from': 'cpu/u_if/write_ptr_q_1_s2', 'to': 'cpu/u_id/reg_q.alu_select.sra_s0', 'slack_ns': -6.542, 'arrival_ns': 16.837, 'logic_cells': 14, 'modules': ['clock_ibuf', 'cpu/u_if', 'cpu/u_hazard', 'cpu/u_id', 'cpu/u_if', 'cpu/u_id']}, 'logic_levels': 11}\nNotes \nseeds [86.638, 94.169, 94.169]\nperturbations [[0, 86.638, 11], [1, 94.169, 11], [2, 94.169, 11]]\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
