{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"rg -ni 'carry.select|carry chain|carry-chain|shorten.*carr|lookahead|parallel.prefix|split.result|propagate' cores/bench/experiments/log.jsonl | python -c 'import json,sys,re; rows=[json.loads(l.split(\\\":\\\",1)[1]) for l in sys.stdin]; pattern=r\\\"carry.select|carry chain|carry-chain|shorten\\\\w* carr|lookahead|parallel.prefix|split.result|propagat\\\"; [print(r[\\\"id\\\"],r[\\\"title\\\"],*[x.strip() for x in re.split(r\\\"(?<=[.])\\\\s+\\\",r.get(\\\"hypothesis\\\",{}).get(\\\"hypothesis\\\",\\\"\\\")+\\\" \\\"+r.get(\\\"implementation_notes\\\",\\\"\\\")) if re.search(pattern,x,re.I)],sep=\\\"\\\\n\\\") for r in rows]'\"","aggregated_output":"hyp-20261122-001-r3s0\nRegister RV32M partial products before accumulation\nUse two levels of carry-save\ncompression and a single final carry-propagate sum.\nhyp-20261122-002-r3s1\nMove RV32M result completion to the memory stage\nSign-extend the cross products before shifting and reduce the weighted\nterms modulo 2^64 with two carry-save reductions and one 48-bit\ncarry-propagate add.\nhyp-20261122-001-r4s0\nReplace serial divider launch trials with a nibble lookup\nThis exposes the high dividend nibble and low divisor\nnibble to the lookup with short local carry chains.\nhyp-20261122-002-r5s1\nPreselect all execute operands and isolate data address generation\nThe offset sign prepares the two possible upper words, and the low carry selects the final word.\nhyp-20261122-001-r6s0\nUse byte-sliced borrow lookahead in the divider\nUse explicit group lookahead from the slice generate and\npropagate signals to drive the byte result muxes and the final trial\nborrow.\nFor a slice, unsigned less-than generates a borrow and equality\npropagates it.\nThis gives Gowin short local carry chains in both radix-4 digits and puts\ngroup lookahead in parallel with local difference calculation.\nhyp-20261122-002-r6s1\nSplit divider rounds by divisor magnitude\nhyp-20261122-003-r10s2\nRead predicted loop words one cycle ahead of replay\nhyp-20261122-001-r11s0\nShare aligned divider trials across both radices\nTaking that bit from the ordinary difference keeps the carry chain available for the upper wide result.\nGowin had split the carry chain at an explicit low-limb tap and routed the borrow between the two stages.\nhyp-20261122-002-r11s1\nCarry split direct targets across the fetch register\nFor aperture qualification, combine middle generate with middle\npropagate AND low carry.\nhyp-20261122-003-r11s2\nReplay predicted loop branches from a registered lookahead buffer\nhyp-20261122-001-r12s0\nPredecode divider magnitude carries on the launch edge\nhyp-20261122-003-r12s2\nGive predicted loop replay its own issue FIFO payload bank\nReuse r11s2's tagged loop lookahead.\nAn accepted taken prediction or recovery invalidates the\npreceding lookahead.\nReset or\naccepted FENCE.I clears replay validity, outstanding fills, and lookahead\nhits.\nhyp-20261122-002-r13s1\nGenerate load and store address sums beside the forwarding lanes\nThe proposed low sums move that mux\nafter the carry chains.\nEX/MEM also captures the selected raw upper base, the carry-or-borrow condition, and one propagation bit for each upper address bit.\nhyp-20261122-003-r13s2\nReplay predicted short loops in place in the issue FIFO\nhyp-20261122-001-r14s0\nForward ADDI from the registered address sum\nhyp-20261122-002-r14s1\nCapture fast producer values on the consumer's issue edge\nThis takes the fast carry-chain outputs directly into the consumer\nselection, eliminating a serial result merge on that path.\nhyp-20261122-003-r14s2\nQueue references to branch-trained instruction streams\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
